range.text:
The fictional Reed scheduler admits a job only when a slot is free.

The toy implementation below returns a decision without starting the job.

```js
function admit(freeSlots) {
  return freeSlots > 0;
}
```

The zero-slot case is the counterexample used in the exercise.

